      "electrical": {
        "claims": "Ebers-Moll transistor at a constant gain of 30 (the datasheet's hFE is at least 25 at 1 A and 10 to 50 at 3 A), collector and emitter resistances for its high-current VCE(sat) and VBE(on); fixtures for the gain at 1 A and 3 A, VCE(sat) and VBE(on) at 3 A.",
        "omissions": [
          "the gain's fall with current (25 at 1 A, down to 10 at 3 A in the limits): it stays 30",
          "the Early effect: the collector current does not rise with VCE",
          "capacitances and fT, so no switching times",
          "temperature: VBE's -2 mV/C and the gain's rise",
          "second breakdown, the safe operating area and damage past the ratings",
          "device-to-device spread within the gain limits",
          "no manufacturer model qualification"
